OL,3,CCricket player at the centre of finger-
OL,4,Cclicking controversy suspended by club
OL,6,FThe Saltburn cricketer at the centre
OL,7,Fof the cheating controversy has been
OL,8,Fsuspended by the club and will not
OL,9,Fplay for them for the "foreseeable
OL,10,Ffuture".
OL,12,FIn a statement, the club have said
OL,13,Fthey are treating the allegation with
OL,14,Fthe "utmost seriousness" and are fully
OL,15,Fco-operating with the league's
OL,16,Finvestigation.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G1/6
