OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F393A1785417509
OL,3,CCricket player at the centre of finger-
OL,4,Cclicking controversy suspended by club
OL,6,FIt comes after a fielder was accused
OL,7,Fof clicking his fingers to get a
OL,8,Fcaught-behind wicket and footage of
OL,9,Fseveral incidents later went viral on
OL,10,Fsocial media.
OL,12,FA video posted on Monday evening was
OL,13,Ffrom Saltburn's second XI victory over
OL,14,FNorton in Division Two and showed the
OL,15,Ffielder clicking his fingers as the
OL,16,Fball passed Norton batter Noman
OL,17,FShabir's bat, before being caught by
OL,18,Fwicketkeeper Josh Bowes which
OL,19,Fpersuaded the umpire to give him out.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G2/6
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
