FL,394,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F393A1785417509
OL,3,CCricket player at the centre of finger-
OL,4,Cclicking controversy suspended by club
OL,6,FSaltburn, who sit 17 points clear at
OL,7,Fthe top of Division Two, won the match
OL,8,Fby 159 runs.
OL,10,FMeanwhile, in the wake of the
OL,11,Fcontroversy, Saltburn did not play
OL,12,Ftheir second-team fixture against
OL,13,FMarton on Wednesday (29 July), and
OL,14,Finstead conceded the game.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G3/6
