OL,3,CCricket player at the centre of finger-
OL,4,Cclicking controversy suspended by club
OL,6,FA statement released on Saltburn's
OL,7,Fsocial media channels read: "This is
OL,8,Fissued in response to the widely
OL,9,Fpublicised complaint made against a
OL,10,FSaltburn Cricket Club member and, as a
OL,11,Fconsequence, against the club more
OL,12,Fgenerally.
OL,14,F"We are treating this allegation with
OL,15,Fthe utmost seriousness and, as a
OL,16,Ffamily-centric club, we are fully
OL,17,Fcooperating with the NYS League's
OL,18,Finvestigation.
OL,26,@oD@]OUvD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G4/6
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,394,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F393A1785417509
OL,3,CCricket player at the centre of finger-
OL,4,Cclicking controversy suspended by club
OL,6,F"We believe that the club acted
OL,7,Fdecisively as soon as the complaint
OL,8,Fand investigation were made known to
OL,9,Fus. The player at the centre of the
OL,10,Fcomplaint has been suspended and will
OL,11,Fnot play again for the club this
OL,12,Fseason or in the foreseeable future,
OL,13,Fpending the outcome of this
OL,14,Finvestigation.
OL,16,F"Initial discussions have already
OL,17,Ftaken place between club officials and
OL,18,Fthe league.
OL,26,@nD@AOUxD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G5/6
