OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,394,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39306
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F393A1785417509
OL,3,CCricket player at the centre of finger-
OL,4,Cclicking controversy suspended by club
OL,6,F"This has been a very distressing and
OL,7,Fstressful experience for all those
OL,8,Fconcerned, and we would ask that this
OL,9,Freality is borne in mind and that
OL,10,Fpersonal boundaries are respected, as
OL,11,Fwe are an amateur club entirely run by
OL,12,Fvolunteers.
OL,14,F"We will be making no further comment
OL,15,Fat this time."
OL,26,@nD@AOUvD@AOUwD@NO]
